OL,3,GNEWSAGWR to cancel services due to
OL,4,Aissues with fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of rail journeys will be
OL,7,Fcancelled across Devon and Cornwall
OL,8,Ffrom next week due to recurring issues
OL,9,Fwith a fleet of trains, a rail operator
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) said five
OL,13,Fweekday services will be cancelled
OL,14,Fbetween Penzance and Plymouth/Exeter
OL,15,Ffrom Monday.
OL,17,FThe issue is down to the company's
OL,18,FClass 175 fleet, which it said had been
OL,19,F"challenging from a reliability
OL,20,Fperspective," prompting too many
OL,21,Fcancellations for customers.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
