OL,3,GNEWSAGWR to cancel services due to
OL,4,Aissues with fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operator said it understood the
OL,7,Ftimetable changes would be "frustrating
OL,8,Ffor customers" but believed the move
OL,9,Fwould "provide a more reliable service
OL,10,Fin the short term" while it worked to
OL,11,Fbring its fleet up to standard.
